### Variables - ALICE
@aliceUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@aliceName = Alice

### Variables - BOB
@bobUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8002
@bobName = Bob

### Variables - CHARLIE
@charlieUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8003
@charlieName = Charlie

### ============================================
### ALICE - BASIC INFO ENDPOINTS (PORT 8001)
### ============================================

### Get Alice home/basic info
GET {{aliceUrl}}/

### Get Alice full status
GET {{aliceUrl}}/status

### Get Alice balance
GET {{aliceUrl}}/balance

### Get Alice blockchain
GET {{aliceUrl}}/chain

### Get Alice mempool
GET {{aliceUrl}}/mempool

### Get Alice node info
GET {{aliceUrl}}/info

### ============================================
### ALICE - TRANSACTION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Alice → Bob (10 coins)
POST {{aliceUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=Bob&amount=10

### Alice → Charlie (15 coins)
POST {{aliceUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=Charlie&amount=15

### Alice → coinbase (5 coins)
POST {{aliceUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=coinbase&amount=5

### ============================================
### ALICE - MINING
### ============================================

### Alice mines a block
POST {{aliceUrl}}/mine

