### ============================================
### NETWORK RECEIVE ENDPOINTS (all nodes have these)
### ============================================

### Alice receives transaction
POST {{aliceUrl}}/receive_transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": "Bob",
  "receiver": "Alice",
  "amount": 5,
  "timestamp": 1234567890.123
}

### Bob receives block
POST {{bobUrl}}/receive_block
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "index": 5,
  "timestamp": 1234567890.123,
  "transactions": [
    {
      "sender": "Alice",
      "receiver": "Bob",
      "amount": 10,
      "timestamp": 1234567890.123
    }
  ],
  "previous_hash": "previous_hash_here",
  "nonce": 12345,
  "hash": "block_hash_here",
  "merkle_root": "merkle_root_here"
}

### Charlie receives new peer notification
POST {{charlieUrl}}/new_peer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "NewNode",
  "uuid": "new-uuid-12345",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 9000,
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000"
}

### ============================================
### COMPLETE WORKFLOW EXAMPLES
### ============================================

### WORKFLOW 1: Alice gets funds and sends to Bob
# Step 1: Request faucet (on coinbase - see test_main.rest)
# POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/faucet with {"node_name": "Alice"}

###
# Step 2: Alice mines the faucet transaction
POST {{aliceUrl}}/mine

###
# Step 3: Check Alice's balance
GET {{aliceUrl}}/balance

###
# Step 4: Alice sends 30 to Bob
POST {{aliceUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=Bob&amount=30

###
# Step 5: Bob mines the transaction
POST {{bobUrl}}/mine

###
# Step 6: Check both balances
GET {{aliceUrl}}/balance
###
GET {{bobUrl}}/balance

### WORKFLOW 2: Multi-node transaction chain
# Alice → Bob → Charlie

###
# Step 1: Alice → Bob (25 coins)
POST {{aliceUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=Bob&amount=25

###
# Step 2: Alice mines
POST {{aliceUrl}}/mine

###
# Step 3: Bob → Charlie (10 coins)
POST {{bobUrl}}/transaction/create?receiver=Charlie&amount=10

###
# Step 4: Charlie mines
POST {{charlieUrl}}/mine

###
# Step 5: Check all balances
GET {{aliceUrl}}/balance
###
GET {{bobUrl}}/balance
###
GET {{charlieUrl}}/balance

